# 🌾 AI-Driven Hyper-Local Business Advisory & Financial Structuring Assistant

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
[![Python 3.10+](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10%2B-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/)
[![Framework](https://img.shields.io/badge/Framework-FastAPI%20%7C%20Streamlit-green.svg)](#)
[![AI Stack](https://img.shields.io/badge/AI%2FLLM-LangChain%20%7C%20LlamaIndex-orange.svg)](#)

An intelligent, multilingual, and voice-enabled decision-support system designed to democratize institutional-grade business consulting for rural and semi-urban micro-entrepreneurs.

---

## 📌 Executive Overview

Rural micro-entrepreneurs often initiate businesses based on anecdotal trends rather than data-backed feasibility studies. Lack of local market insights and financial literacy leads to high failure rates and underutilization of government credit schemes. 

This platform bridges the gap by combining **Hyper-Local Business Intelligence** (evaluating market saturation, regional demand, and SWOT risks) with an automated **Smart Scheme Calculator & Financial Router** (mapping available margin capital to government-backed concessional credit schemes).

---

## 🌟 Core Modules & Features

### 🏢 Module 1: Hyper-Local Business Feasibility Report
* **5–10 km Market Radius Reach:** Estimates immediate consumer base and suggests distribution channels based on Gram Panchayat / Block demographic data.
* **Opportunity & Niche Identification:** Identifies underserved market gaps in chosen business categories (e.g., Dairy, Retail, Textiles, Handicrafts).
* **Automated SWOT Analysis:** Generates a hyper-local breakdown of Strengths, Weaknesses, Opportunities, and Threats tailored specifically to the user's budget.
* **Competitor & Density Mapping:** Evaluates local business saturation to prevent over-competition in a given village cluster.
* **Pricing & Value Proposition:** Recommends optimal pricing strategies based on regional purchasing power.
* **Threat Mitigation:** Highlights supply chain bottlenecks, single-buyer dependency, and seasonal demand fluctuations.

### 💰 Module 2: Smart Financial Calculator & Scheme Router
* **Automatic Margin-to-Loan Ratio Calculation:**
  $$\text{Total Project Cost} = \frac{\text{Available Margin Capital}}{10\%}$$
  $$\text{Maximum Eligible Loan} = 90\% \times \text{Total Project Cost}$$
* **Dynamic Government Scheme Auto-Selection:**
  * **Micro Finance Scheme** ($\text{Project Cost} \le \text{₹1.40 Lakh}$):
    * Concessional Interest Rate: **6.5% p.a.**
    * Loan Tenure: **3 Years**
    * Moratorium: **3 Months**
  * **Term Loan Scheme** ($\text{₹1.40 Lakh} < \text{Project Cost} \le \text{₹50.00 Lakh}$):
    * Concessional Interest Rate: **8.0% p.a.**
    * Loan Tenure: **7 Years**
    * Moratorium: **6 Months**
* **Repayment Schedule Generator:** Outlines quarterly EMI payments, working capital requirements, operational buffers, and moratorium phase adjustments.

