## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Domain | Technology / Tools |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Frontend UI** | React.js / Streamlit / Tailwind CSS |
| **Backend API** | FastAPI (Python) |
| **AI / NLP** | OpenAI GPT-4 / Meta Llama 3 / LangChain / Bhashini API (Voice & Translation) |
| **Geospatial & Demographics** | OpenStreetMap API / Census Data / Regional Market Datasets |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (Relational) + Qdrant / Pinecone (Vector Search) |
| **Deployment** | Docker / AWS / Hugging Face Spaces |

